  "changes": [
    "Canonical named door identity remains; scan deterministic centroids and vertex insets of actual surviving convex sections. Scan at most16 material targets per retry batch, preserving the cursor across blocked batches.",
    "Choose supported, body/person-clear standing or crouched bays with physical sight of the named leaf and a navigable route; actual ordinary hand ray and finite stock still control work.",
    "Invalidate missing targets after damage; blocked tasks wait/retry, publish Waiting for access, spend no stock and clear correctly on cancellation, completion or human takeover.",
    "Named squad tool handling audio uses the stable planned material point; physical reach rays still gate work. A direct snapshot diff identified two ULPs only in the old handling sound position, with matching actor state and private goals/aim.",
    "Snapshot behavior byte adds one validated flag with no extra packet bytes. New deterministic behavior requires matched v37 peers, journals and saves."
  ],
